---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="About Ishpreet — founding engineer, writer, and builder.">

  <section class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-24 pt-10 pb-20">
    <!-- Back link -->
    <a href="/" class="text-[13px] text-on-surface-variant inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-10 hover:text-on-surface transition-colors">
      &larr; Home
    </a>

    <!-- ASCII name hero -->
    <div
      class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden relative mb-16"
      style="background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--ghost-border); height: 200px;"
    >
      <canvas data-ascii-name="ishpreet" class="w-full h-full" aria-hidden="true" />
    </div>
    <script src="../scripts/ascii-name.ts" />

    <!-- Bio -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_320px] gap-16 items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="font-serif italic text-[22px] text-on-surface leading-[1.45] max-w-[48ch] mb-12" style="text-wrap: balance;">
          A developer who can't leave well enough alone. Writing about what happens when you open the source and count for yourself.
        </p>

        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-[62ch]">
          <p>
            I'm Ishpreet — a founding engineer at an early-stage startup. I joined as a frontend intern and converted to the founding team; now I work across the stack.
          </p>

          <p>
            I don't just use tools — I open the source, read the data, and figure out what's actually happening. This blog is where I publish the findings. Technical research, deep dives into developer tooling, and investigations into the systems we use every day. The goal is always the same: understand how things actually work, not how the marketing says they work.
          </p>

          <p>
            When an investigation turns up something worth fixing, I build the fix. <a href="https://github.com/ishpreet95/ccmetrics" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ccmetrics</a>, a Rust CLI for accurate Claude Code token accounting, is the most recent example. The rest lives on the <a href="/projects">projects page</a>.
          </p>

          <p>
            If you want to follow along, the <a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a> is the best way. No newsletter signup forms, no tracking pixels — just content.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sidebar — links & colophon -->
      <aside class="lg:sticky lg:top-10">
        <div class="bg-surface-low rounded-xl p-7">
          <div class="eyebrow mb-5">Elsewhere</div>
          <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 grid gap-3.5 text-[14px]">
            <li>
              <a href="https://github.com/ishpreet95" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 1.27a11 11 0 0 0-3.48 21.44c.55.1.75-.24.75-.53v-1.85c-3.06.66-3.71-1.48-3.71-1.48-.5-1.27-1.22-1.6-1.22-1.6-1-.68.08-.67.08-.67 1.1.08 1.68 1.13 1.68 1.13.98 1.68 2.57 1.2 3.2.91.1-.7.38-1.2.7-1.47-2.44-.28-5-1.22-5-5.43 0-1.2.43-2.18 1.13-2.94-.11-.28-.49-1.4.1-2.92 0 0 .92-.3 3.03 1.12a10.5 10.5 0 0 1 5.5 0c2.1-1.42 3.02-1.12 3.02-1.12.6 1.52.22 2.64.1 2.92.71.76 1.13 1.74 1.13 2.94 0 4.22-2.57 5.14-5.02 5.42.4.34.75 1 .75 2.03v3.01c0 .3.2.64.76.53A11 11 0 0 0 12 1.27z"/></svg>
                GitHub
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://x.com/IshpreetV95" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M17.53 3h3.08l-6.73 7.69L22 21h-6.2l-4.86-6.36L5.28 21H2.2l7.2-8.22L2 3h6.36l4.39 5.81L17.53 3zm-1.08 16.13h1.7L7.63 4.78H5.8l10.65 14.35z"/></svg>
                X / Twitter
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ishpreet-vashist/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M4.98 3.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 5 8.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-.02-5zM3 9h4v12H3zM9 9h3.8v1.7h.06c.53-1 1.82-2.05 3.75-2.05 4 0 4.74 2.64 4.74 6.08V21h-4v-5.6c0-1.34-.02-3.06-1.87-3.06-1.87 0-2.16 1.46-2.16 2.96V21H9z"/></svg>
                LinkedIn
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="mailto:ishpreetsingh95@gmail.com" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
                Email
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/rss.xml" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 11a9 9 0 0 1 9 9M4 4a16 16 0 0 1 16 16"/><circle cx="5" cy="19" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
                RSS feed
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 bg-surface-low rounded-xl p-7">
          <div class="eyebrow mb-5">Colophon</div>
          <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 grid gap-2.5 text-[13px] text-on-surface-variant font-mono">
            <li>Set in Newsreader, Inter &amp; Geist Mono</li>
            <li>Built with Astro</li>
            <li>Hosted on Vercel</li>
            <li>Covers generated with Perlin noise</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
